title: Authorizations › New case › Medical records › Patient and insurance rows
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 2, Patient and Insurance lists)
intro: Each field row says where its value came from, and its button opens a small editor under the row. Edits go straight into the draft. This diagram also covers 'Pull a chart from EMR Connect'. The Coverage row has its own diagram.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 2, read the Patient and Insurance rows"
screen sc "Patient: 'Patient initials and age'\nInsurance: 'Payer and plan', 'Member ID', 'Coverage'\nEach row: a box, a label, a detail line and one button"

group gState "What a row can say"
  decision dSrc "Does the row have a value?"
  process r1 "Read from a file\n'Read from chart.pdf by Reader. Check it.'"
  process r3 "From a referral\n'From referral RF-2054'"
  process r4 "From EMR Connect\n'From EMR Connect'"
  process r2 "Typed by a person\nThe detail shows the value with no source note"
  process r5 "Missing\n'Not found yet. Drop a chart above or add it here.'\nRow shaded, button 'Add'"
  process r6 "Half filled\n'Found initials J.M.. The age is still needed.'"
  process rNote "A source note goes quiet as soon as the value is edited"
endgroup

click cEdit "Click 'Add' (empty row) or 'Edit' (filled row)"
overlay oEd "Editor opens under the row\nFirst box takes focus\nOnly one editor is open at a time"
click cAgain "Click the same row button again"
process pClose "Editor closes"

group gPatient "Patient initials and age"
  input iInit "Type 'Patient initials'\nUp to 8 letters, shown in capitals, e.g. J.M."
  input iAge "Type 'Age' (1 to 110)"
  process pName "Hint: 'Initials and age only. A name never enters the app.'"
endgroup

group gPayer "Payer and plan"
  input iPayer "Pick 'Payer' (Choose a payer)\nSix payers"
  process pPlan "'Plan type' fills in for that payer\nHMO, PPO, Medicare Advantage..."
  input iPlan "Optional: pick another 'Plan type'"
endgroup

group gMember "Member ID"
  input iMember "Type 'Member ID'"
  process pMask "Detail shows only the last four, e.g. …4821\n'agents see only the last four'"
endgroup

click cDone "Click 'Done', or press Escape in a text box"
store stLive "Every keystroke is written to the draft\nNothing to save"
process pStale "If the agents had already run, the run restarts\nAnswers and summary edits are cleared"
goto g40 "Continues in: Medical records › The Coverage row"

group gEmr "EMR pull"
  click cPull "Click 'Pull a chart from EMR Connect'\nClicking again closes the picker"
  overlay oPick "Chart from EMR Connect\nPicker with a chart list, 'Pull' and 'Cancel'"
  input iChart "Pick a chart\nJ.M., 34 · Summit · Residential 3.5 · A.R. · S.T. · L.G."
  click cPullGo "Click 'Pull'"
  process pPulling "Button reads 'Pulling' for about 1 second\nThe list and 'Cancel' switch off"
  ext xEmr "EMR Connect (demo: simulated)\nThe chart's patient, payer, member ID, level of care, type, diagnoses and reason"
  store stEmr "Draft filled, replacing those fields\nNo documents come with it"
  toast tEmr "'Pulled J.M., 34 from EMR Connect'\n'Everything below was filled in from the chart. You can still change it.'"
  click cCancelEmr "Click 'Cancel'"
  process pCancelEmr "Picker closes; nothing changes"
endgroup

s1 --> sc --> dSrc
dSrc -->|Read by Reader| r1
dSrc -->|From a referral| r3
dSrc -->|From the EMR| r4
dSrc -->|Typed| r2
dSrc -->|No| r5
dSrc -->|Only one of two| r6
r1 --> rNote
r3 --> rNote
r4 --> rNote

sc --> cEdit --> oEd
oEd --> iInit
iInit --> iAge --> pName
oEd --> iPayer --> pPlan --> iPlan
oEd --> iMember --> pMask
r5 --> cEdit
r6 --> cEdit
pName --> cDone
iPlan --> cDone
pMask --> cDone
cDone --> stLive --> pStale
oEd --> cAgain --> pClose
cDone --> pClose
sc --> g40

sc --> cPull --> oPick --> iChart --> cPullGo --> pPulling --> xEmr --> stEmr --> tEmr
oPick --> cCancelEmr --> pCancelEmr
stEmr -.-> pStale
